WEBVTT

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:52.700
I'm not letting you get ahead!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.220
Watch closely and see if this Z is really the devil.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.240
I don't get it!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.270
I just don't get it

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.200
Tatsuya, my brother, even you!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:29.970
Watch!

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:31.300
It's not over yet.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:34.470
When we finish, tell me if you still
think this Z belongs to the devil.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.540
Don't...

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.930
This Z will betray you.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:53.500
My brother loved it so much, too.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.650
No!

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.140
It's not his fault.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.250
The exact same situation as last time.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.160
But, I won't make the same mistake twice!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.710
Whatever happened in the past,
you're my machine now, Z!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>You won't betray me...</i>

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.090
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.600
<i>It wasn't your fault that we crashed.</i>

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.090
<i>Right, Z?</i>

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.030
Ahh! He did it again!

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.040
Akio!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.730
<i>Akio!!</i>
Akio!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:55.960
Hey!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.260
Can you get up, Akio?

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.510
I'm fine, Mah.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.340
I was just in a good mood...

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.850
Huh? What the hell are you talking about?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.140
Just now...

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.780
That was my mistake, not the Z's.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.270
The Z didn't betray me.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.730
Tell the BlackBird for me,

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.570
I'll be on Wangan again... the Z and me.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.120
<i>That's right this is where it begins...</i>

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.620
<i>Our "Wangan" story... Z.</i>

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:47.600
<i>The GT-R girl</i>

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.450
Alright, can you lift you hair a little?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.820
Yeah, just like that!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.030
Reina-chan improved a lot recently.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:03.820
Yes.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.860
Thanks to you, the green tea
commercial is really popular, too.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.820
We're gonna try and get a lot more jobs, now.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.020
Ok, thank you very much!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.580
Hey, Reina! Wait a sec!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:23.340
I already said, you have to be more
friendly to the agents and sponsors.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:25.670
Yeah, I know.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.010
I'll be careful.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.710
Do you really get it?

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.610
The next six months are going to decide a lot...

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:33.890
Hey!

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.200
Good work today.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.890
Tomorrow at 12:00, don't forget
you have to shoot "Drive Go Go".

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:49.300
I wish she would spend less time with those cars... geez.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:03.630
<i>Are cars that fun?</i>

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.710
<i>If you get into an accident, it can't be undone.</i>

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:10.390
<i>Your image is so important in this world.</i>

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.410
<i>And this is a crucial time.</i>

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.380
<i>I need you to realize that.</i>

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:17.570
<i>No way...</i>

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.790
<i>It's such an old Z, too.</i>

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:22.780
<i>Who is that guy?</i>

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.460
<i>I don't believe this.</i>

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.470
The steering is very responsive,

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.330
and the traction is stable, too.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.220
Check, ok!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:52.730
And next week, we'll be looking at 4WDs for families.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.600
By the way, Reina-chan...

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:55.990
Something on your mind?

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:59.490
Yes, I ride a GT-R.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:03.510
But I encountered a really fast Z on Wangan recently.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.350
It was like a jet or something.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.420
Are you watching, Z's driver?

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.100
Don't over speed, ok?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.250
We'll see you next week.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.480
Goodbye.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:17.010
Drive Go Go!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.060
Ok! Thank you very much!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.110
It's true, Kijima-san.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:29.010
He took me over 180km/h, and still accelerated.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.000
A Z that beat Reina-chan when she's serious, eh?

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:35.500
I thought I got on his tail, then he just shook me.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.830
I couldn't even keep up.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:43.490
But Reina-chan, S30-Z's only got 120 horsepower.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.500
120 horsepower?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.700
You're kidding, right?

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.500
How can I lose to something like that?

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:52.210
That just can't be possible.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.750
If that were the case, it must be a L-Type 2800, bored up.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.010
L-2800?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.330
Normal Z's only have 2000, but...

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:05.000
But you bore it up using 130 or a Cedric 2800.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.010
You can bring it to 3000.

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:08.560
Then, you slap a turbo on that.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.060
With a single, you can get 250 horsepower.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:14.320
With a Twin Turbo, you can get over 350.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.440
Wait a second, Kijima-san.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.820
My GT-R has over 400.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.330
You shouldn't lose to a moderately tuned Z.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:33.400
Of course not...

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:39.090
But, what if that were... the car known as the Devil Z?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.640
Devil Z?

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.170
It exists...

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.750
It has something that transcends all specs.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:49.650
And it's said to be fast like the devil... an S30-Z.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.660
It's starting to look pretty good.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:56.400
Yeah.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.120
All we need to do now, is tighten the chases.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.120
You really fell in love with this Z, didn't you?

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.000
You crashed it twice and you fixed it up this much?

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.170
Putting all of your part-time money into it.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.550
Yesterday, I went to Wangan for
the first time after I fixed it up.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:15.680
How was it?

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.740
It was great.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.000
It was better than before.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.680
I think it's starting to accept me.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.460
Reina-chan, do you know the BlackBird?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:31.190
It's the Porsche, said to be the fastest
on the coast right now, but...

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:35.530
That Z used to be with the BlackBird.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.990
<i>BlackBird?</i>

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:52.960
You sound great.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.000
I think you're almost complete.

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:59.190
It's felt so long... the six months that you were gone.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:03.180
Alright, let's go to Wangan again.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.020
This time, I won't lose...

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.480
BlackBird.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.000
<i>That Z used to be with the BlackBird.</i>

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:27.770
<i>But two years ago, that Z go into
an accident and the driver died.</i>

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:35.270
<i>After it was fixed, every succeeding
owner has gotten into an accident.</i>

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:40.130
<i>It's as if the Z was denying all other owners except its first.</i>

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:54.650
<i>If the Z that beat your GT-R was that one...</i>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.910
The Devil Z.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:16.160
<i>I'll make it clear today.</i>

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.750
<i>Are you really the Devil Z?</i>

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.180
<i>Yesterday's...</i>

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.250
<i>He's fast.</i>

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.050
<i>I can't keep up.</i>

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.510
<i>There's no mistake...</i>

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:12.870
<i>That's...</i>

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:34.250
There he is.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.630
Hmm...

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.500
<i>If that were the case, it's probably a L-2800 bored up.</i>

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.450
<i>This is a L-2800?</i>

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.110
Umm...

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:00.260
Have we met before?

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.020
Oh, right there.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:08.810
I see.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:14.360
I wanna ride this car, yeah?

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.420
No luck?

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.760
Oops, I don't have any change.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:29.680
Can you buy me a drink, please?

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.490
Sure, what do you want?

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.190
I'm sorry, just a little bit.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:38.680
Idiot! Don't do it!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:39.690
Don't ride that Z.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.850
<i>What is this...</i>

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.570
<i>It's like power is overflowing from
the ground into the car.</i>

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:08.380
<i>It's not like a normal car at all.</i>

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:20.890
<i>Amazing...</i>

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.500
<i>I can keep stepping on the throttle.</i>

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:27.280
<i>This must be the Devil Z.</i>

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.430
Hey, are you ok?

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.250
I'm sorry.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.970
I just had to ride this car.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:07.150
But, I think I kind of understand...

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.640
Why this car is called the Devil Z.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:15.160
I'm Akikawa Reina.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.010
Asakura Akio.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:22.410
Remember that.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:28.900
Very soon, this car's gonna eat my GT-R's dust.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.720
The GT-R is a pretty good car to begin with.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:48.740
So all you need to do to get 400hp is increase
the boost and tweak the CP programming.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:52.200
But if you want to get 600,

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.550
you'll have to mess with the engine.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.230
Swap the turbine for a bigger one.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:02.270
And you'll have to change the chases
to support that kind of power.

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:04.020
Hmm...

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.500
This car's going to be amazing.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.710
I'm really reluctant to do it, Reina-chan.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:12.000
But if I turn you down, you'll have it done elsewhere.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:16.810
That's why I would rather do it myself and do a good job.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:19.550
Thank you, I'm really trusting you!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.560
<i>We can't say "no" to that smile... old geezers like me.</i>

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.360
You had the engine broken-in, right?

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.450
Yeah.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.510
500km at 5,000rpm.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.620
Then you can take it up to 10,000 today.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.670
Boss, how much does it have?

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:31.170
Around 600 with the chases, just like I promised.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.800
Still not satisfied?

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.540
<i>It's different...</i>

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.170
<i>It doesn't feel like that Z.</i>

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:43.380
<i>I can't just increase the power?</i>

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.730
What's the matter?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.480
Um...

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:50.670
That Porsche...

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.130
Could that be the...

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.240
BlackBird?

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.190
<i>He's looking for it.</i>

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.190
<i>The Devil Z.</i>

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.850
No, Reina-chan.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:19.750
Don't push it yet.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.500
Eh? But...

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.760
Let this one go.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.170
You saw the BlackBird?

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:45.240
When?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.830
Yesterday on Wangan.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.030
I see.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.110
I haven't seen him in a while, so I was
wondering what he was up to.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.320
He was cruising in the slow lane.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:57.590
As if he was waiting for someone.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.760
The BlackBird is appearing again.

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.450
I guess they're looking for us, too.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.650
And someone else...

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.530
I guess we should head out...

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:26.280
to Wangan.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:34.300
<i>Cars going around 100km/h look like traffic cones.</i>

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.020
<i>I'm so much faster, but why...?</i>

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.760
<i>What's different?</i>

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:46.670
<i>That feeling I get when I'm around the Z and the BlackBird.</i>

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.770
<i>It's like they're not machines.</i>

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:49.720
<i>But alive...</i>

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.630
<i>He's not challenging me.</i>

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:10.820
<i>But he's not trying to pass me, either.</i>

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.000
<i>We're after the same thing.</i>

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:15.750
<i>Until he shows up...</i>

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.990
<i>The two of us gonna have a little rendezvous?</i>

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:35.010
<i>I've been doing over 180km/h.</i>

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:37.400
<i>U-turning at Ooi.</i>

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:40.750
<i>Taking the Kanjo-sen back to Wangan.</i>

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.750
<i>How many laps is this?</i>

00:21:48.310 --> 00:21:50.740
<i>You're not even trying, BlackBird...</i>

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:54.270
<i>And neither is my GT-R.</i>

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:58.340
<i>I can read it like a book...</i>

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:02.770
<i>What you're thinking right now.</i>

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:08.140
<i>There he is!</i>

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:10.980
<i>The Devil Z!</i>

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.740
<i>The GT-R's power's different from last time.</i>

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:25.490
<i>So you wanna aplay?</i>

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:27.020
<i>Let's do it.</i>

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:37.840
<i>No, BlackBird.</i>

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:40.590
<i>He's gonna eat -my- dust.</i>
